-- Demo matches + elo_history for local dev / staging.
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING on both tables. Reapply at any time.
-- Depends on: demo_players.sql (must run first — FKs to fake_player_001..016).
--
-- Period: May 1–8, 2026 (matches CLAUDE.md's currentDate). 40 SINGLES matches,
-- gendered (M-vs-M / F-vs-F) so the SH/SD client filter works. ~9 of them are
-- upsets (winner ELO < loser ELO − 100 at match time) so the giant-killer
-- ranking has content.
--
-- elo_before in every elo_history row = the player's current users.elo_singles.
-- This is a simplification — in reality ELO drifts after each match. The
-- ranking aggregates only read elo_before per match for upset detection, so
-- this is sufficient for the demo. elo_after = elo_before ± delta (15 regular,
-- 25 for upsets); this isn't read by the ranking endpoints but stays plausible
-- for any other consumer (e.g. profile history).
--
-- Performance points scale with the win difficulty: ~40 vs weaker opponent,
-- ~60 vs similar, ~95–110 for upsets.
--
-- Run with: make seed-matches  (after make seed-players)

